# Tokens for the `declared` target: `cargo +nightly fuzz run declared -- -dict=declared.dict`.
# The shapes a coverage-guided search rarely composes byte by byte: a month name between
# date separators, a two-digit year, the designators, and a packed `enum` entry.
"Jan"
"feb"
"MAR"
"Dec"
"7-Jan-2026"
"07-Jan-26"
"Jan/7/2026"
"2026-Jan-07"
"20260107"
" PM"
"T15:04:05"
"+05"
"Z"
"1,23,456"
"1,234,567"
"\x01\x00\x00\x00F"
"\x04\x00\x00\x00Male"
